For Dad's build, the local civil day-of-month is a steady provisional blue marker on row 7:
day 1 maps to (0,7), day 15 to (14,7), and day 31 to (30,7), exactly one
marker at a time. Coordinate (31,7) remains available. The marker is subordinate
